>\n\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato de Samora Machel sobre fondo guilloché; dos puntos táctiles para débiles visuales en la esquina superior derecha.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> manada de tres antílopes kudú mayor (<em>Tragelaphus strepsiceros</em>) en la llanura africana.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Leyenda legal:</strong> &ldquo;A falsificação de moeda é punida nos termos da lei&rdquo; en el margen inferior.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> marrón, ocre, verde y subtonos dorados.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 100 METICAIS ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">100 Meticais &middot; 2011</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Samora Moisés Machel &middot; Familia de Jirafas</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"mozambique-100-meticais-2011\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 100 Meticais\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-100-meticais-2011-polimero-320.webp 320w, /uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-100-meticais-2011-polimero.webp 564w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 48px), 560px\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-100-meticais-2011-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 100 Meticais de polímero del Banco de Moçambique, anverso arriba con retrato de Samora Machel, reverso abajo con una familia de jirafas\" width=\"564\" height=\"491\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Ampliar</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Mozambique</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco de Moçambique</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero puro &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">De La Rue (Reino Unido)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fecha de Emisión</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">16 de junio de 2011</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmante</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Ernesto Gove (O Governador)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">147 &times; 65 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-149a</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Un héroe de la independencia en la moneda:</strong> Samora Moisés Machel (1933&ndash;1986), líder revolucionario y primer Presidente de Mozambique tras la independencia de Portugal en 1975, preside las tres denominaciones de esta ficha, con la fauna protegida del país &mdash;rinoceronte negro, kudú y jirafa&mdash; ilustrada en cada reverso.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Polímero para el clima tropical:</strong> el Banco de Moçambique emitió estas versiones de polímero de las tres denominaciones más bajas el 16 de junio de 2011, como parte de una familia renovada de billetes que mantuvo el diseño de la serie de 2006 pero con seguridad mejorada; las denominaciones más altas (200, 500 y 1.000 meticais) permanecieron en papel, mientras que estas tres se convirtieron a polímero para resistir mejor el clima húmedo y tropical del país.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2,3</sup></p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato de perfil de Samora Machel; tres puntos táctiles en el borde superior para invidentes.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> una familia de tres jirafas (<em>Giraffa camelopardalis</em>) corriendo en un bosque de acacias.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana ovalada:</strong> área de polímero completamente transparente, principal barrera contra la falsificación xerográfica.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> rojo ladrillo, carmín, rosa y amarillo multicolor.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Foreign Currency &amp; Coin, &ldquo;Mozambique 20 Meticais&rdquo; y &ldquo;Mozambique 50 Meticais&rdquo;, <em>foreigncurrencyandcoin.com</em>: retrato de Samora Moisés Machel (1933&ndash;1986), primer presidente de Mozambique, en el anverso de las tres denominaciones.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Grokipedia, &ldquo;Mozambican metical&rdquo;: &ldquo;In 2011, the Banco de Moçambique issued polymer substrate versions of the 20, 50, and 100 metical notes to enhance durability in the country's humid tropical climate&hellip; The higher denominations (200, 500, and 1,000 meticais) remained on paper.&rdquo;</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">3. Numisworld, &ldquo;Mozambique 20 Meticais Banknote, 2011, P-149a&rdquo;: emitido el 16 de junio de 2011, impreso por De La Rue (Londres), firmado por el Gobernador Ernesto Gouveia Gove.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n    <aside aria-labelledby=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:900px; margin:48px auto 0; padding-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n      <h2 id=\"related-reading-heading\" style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px; font-style:normal;\">Sigue explorando</h2>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:14px;\">\n        <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/haiti-1-2-50-gourdes/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Haití — gourdes de polímero</a>\n        <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/rumania-lei/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Rumania — lei de polímero</a>\n        <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Colección mundial de polímero</a>\n        <a href=\"/glosario/#polimero\" style=\"display:block; padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); color:#332e22; text-decoration:none; line-height:1.45;\">Glosario: polímero</a>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\" data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Cerrar\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button disabled=\"false\" aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\">\n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-20-meticais-2011-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-20-meticais-2011-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 20 Meticais, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-50-meticais-2011-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-50-meticais-2011-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 50 Meticais, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n        \n          <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-100-meticais-2011-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/mozambique-banco-de-mocambique-100-meticais-2011-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 100 Meticais, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        \n      </div>\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
